The Lua file `collab-comments.lua` (which carries a reviewer's Word comments
back into the DOCX render) is derived from the `docx` branch of
MikeLydeamore/collab-comments at tag `v1.1.0`, redistributed and modified under
the terms of the MIT License reproduced below.

Modifications: the HTML export, the live preview bridge and its descriptor
discovery are dropped, with the JavaScript and CSS dependencies they loaded; the
file is reformatted to this project's Lua conventions; and the rewrite pass is
widened beyond the top-level blocks the upstream version supports.

Upstream: https://github.com/MikeLydeamore/collab-comments

